^warning: ignoring
--
String methods on symbolic (non-constant) strings return unconstrained
nondet. strip() should guarantee len(result) <= len(input) but the
nondet result has no such constraint. Fix: add assume() constraints
on nondet returns (e.g., len(strip(s)) <= len(s), find() in [-1, len)).
Affects ~41 ESBMC tests.
